7. In the result, the Criminal Petition is allowed with the following conditions:
(i) In the event of his arrest, the Petitioner/Accused No.16 shall be enlarged on bail,
on execution of a personal bond for a sum of Rs.20,000/-
(Rupees Twenty Thousand only), with two sureties for the like sum each to the satisfaction of the arresting police officials;
(ii) The Petitioner/Accused No.16 shall make himself available for investigation as and when required;
(iii) The Petitioner/Accused No.16 shall not cause any threat, inducement or promise to the prosecution witnesses;

